      "created_at": "2019-02-03T10:27:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So not a backer but hope to be before it ends so I wanted to ask here a few things.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1: The 200k mark is that one really long named adventure or is it two books?</p>\n<p>2: I thought Sentinels of Freedom was what Freedom Five was now after Pual retires is Jim now the fifth member you didn't say respectively in the update talking about Heritage and Time-Slinger. Also wouldn't Pual more or less have the same powers as his character sheet from SK?</p>\n<p>3: I'm not big on Fright Train is Ermine like The Vandals and you have to have her and Train in same campaign to be much fun for GM to control? Cuz I played Stolen Legacy and it was a bit meh to have the Vandals save Stygian put up much of a fight.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:52:25.902Z",
