      "created_at": "2019-02-03T13:33:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Sentinels of Freedom is Legacy (Felicia), Bunker, Wraith, Tachyon, and Absolute Zero. &nbsp; The only change to the team is one Legacy for another. &nbsp; Felicia also plays a mentor role for Daybreak but that doesn’t stop her from being a part of Sentinels of Freedom. &nbsp;Time-Slinger hangs out with the Sentinels of Freedom as we got in the Letters Page but considering his background it seems unlikely he’d be a permanent part of team. &nbsp;</p>",
